//
//  Algorithm -- the standard shift-and-LUT exponential:
//
//      e^x = 2^(x * log2 e) = 2^ki * 2^kf,  ki = floor(k), kf = k - ki
//
//  so the integer part becomes a barrel shift and only 2^kf (a value in
